      "value": "I have just been informed that there is a new settings toggle \"Show Contextual Controls\" which replaces this old setting \"Interactive Object Tooltips\". While I disagree with the new naming, considering it's very much a \"tooltip\" for \"objects\" and not a \"contextual control\", if the new toggle replaces the old setting, that old setting should be removed.",
