  "details": "On live, setting \"Interactive Object Tooltips\" to \"Highlight Only\" only shows an outline for objects. Setting the option to \"Tooltip\" shows a text tooltip on the objects.\n\nOn open beta, \"Highlight Only\" also shows the text tooltip for objects when it should only show the outline of the object.",
